OL,5,G0100 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FThe women decide to hold a
OL,7,     Ffarewell party for Karen to cheer
OL,8,     Fher up. Jean arranges an interview
OL,9,     Ffor Leanne as a supermarket
OL,10,     Fcashier. Meg discusses Peter
OL,11,     FClements's thesis with Jean.
OL,12,G0205 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,13,     FJean asks Erica to keep Leanne's
OL,14,     Farrest from Noeline, so she has
OL,15,     Fthe papers censored. Greg refuses
OL,16,     Fto examine Doreen's foot, so Bea
OL,17,     Fdeclares a hunger strike.
